{"page":553,"verses":[{"verse_key":"62:1","surah":62,"ayah":1,"ar_uthmani":" يُسَبِّحُ لِلَّهِ مَا فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَمَا فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ ٱلْمَلِكِ ٱلْقُدُّوسِ ٱلْعَزِيزِ ٱلْحَكِيمِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Everything in the heavens and earth glorifies God, the Controller, the Holy One, the Almighty, the Wise.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يُسَبِّحُ","en_gloss":"Glorifies","transliteration":"yusabbiḥu","verse_key":"62:1"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لِلَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"lillahi","verse_key":"62:1"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"whatever","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"62:1"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"62:1"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"62:1"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and whatever","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"62:1"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"62:1"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"62:1"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْمَلِكِ","en_gloss":"the Sovereign","transliteration":"l-maliki","verse_key":"62:1"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْقُدُّوسِ","en_gloss":"the Holy","transliteration":"l-qudūsi","verse_key":"62:1"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْعَزِيزِ","en_gloss":"the All-Mighty","transliteration":"l-ʿazīzi","verse_key":"62:1"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْحَكِيمِ","en_gloss":"the All-Wise","transliteration":"l-ḥakīmi","verse_key":"62:1"},{"pos":13,"ar":"١","en_gloss":"(1)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"62:1"}]},{"verse_key":"62:2","surah":62,"ayah":2,"ar_uthmani":"هُوَ ٱلَّذِى بَعَثَ فِى ٱلْأُمِّيِّـۧنَ رَسُولًا مِّنْهُمْ يَتْلُوا۟ عَلَيْهِمْ ءَايَـٰتِهِۦ وَيُزَكِّيهِمْ وَيُعَلِّمُهُمُ ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ وَٱلْحِكْمَةَ وَإِن كَانُوا۟ مِن قَبْلُ لَفِى ضَلَـٰلٍ مُّبِينٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It is He who raised a mes-senger, among the people who had no Scripture, to recite His revelations to them, to make them grow spiritually and teach them the Scri